{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":94,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":94,"text":"A read-and-reset counter is a real design and adding a second collector is","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":95,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":95,"text":"a read. A read that resets is not one: each collector measures the interval","end":"\n"}
